<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Hello guys, I'm new here and have had my first DMR device for 3 days and have already programmed it to death, I've been looking to solve this problem for days. Resetting the GD77 using the key combination was unsuccessful. The problem is I get into update mode (both side buttons under PTT and switch on at the same time) I can't get into update mode at all anymore, when I go to Id Info in the menu in the GD77 then the last line says ROM Error_01<br>I would be very grateful if someone could help me, thanks in advance, Reini</div></blockquote>Sounds like you are running the official firmware and have somehow corrupted the Flash memory or the ROM in the CPU<br><br>The only way to recover from this is to open the radio and connect a hardware programmer dongle to the CPU, to erase it and the reprogram the bootloader<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Mon Jan 01, 2024 8:21 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
